invalid type: string "A chat app between localhost in a computer refers to a messaging\napplication that allows users to communicate with each other within\nthe same computer system.When we say \"localhost\", we are referring\nto the computer system itself. Every computer has a local IP\naddress, which is usually \"127.0.0.1\" or \"localhost\". \nShopping cart\n (11/2022 - 12/2022)\n\n64ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ